  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-bridges",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n> This project is implemented by DeepSeek Harness.\n\n[](https://github.com/yhlooo/dsh-bridges/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-bridges)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-bridges)\n[](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-bridges",
      "text": "A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) plugin that bridges projects already configured for Claude Code, CodeBuddy Code, OpenCode, Codex, Pi, Gemini CLI, or Cursor into DeepSeek Harness, so existing skills, commands, memory, and hooks continue to work without any migration."
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "Requires DeepSeek Harness 0.1.5-rc.1 or newer.\n\n```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "Web UI example:",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-bridges\ndsh web    # = dsh --profile web\n```\n\n```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "headless (one-shot CLI) is also supported — the invoking directory is the workspace:",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile headless add dsh-bridges\ncd my-project\ndsh --profile headless \"list the skills available in your catalog\"\n```\n\nTo install from a checkout of this repository, build it first: `pnpm install && pnpm build && dsh plugin --profile <profile-name> add .`"
    },
    {
      "section": "headless (one-shot CLI) is also supported — the invoking directory is the workspace:",
      "text": "Complete example projects for each agent tool are available in [`examples/`](examples/) (`claude-code`, `codebuddy-code`, `opencode`, `codex`, `pi`, `gemini-cli`, `cursor`); open one as the session workspace to observe its skills, memory, and hooks being bridged."
    },
    {
      "section": "Support matrix",
      "text": "Assets are discovered per session workspace, from project and user-level locations. All bridges are enabled by default and can be configured or disabled from any patch layer:\n\n```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "example: disable the Pi bridge",
      "text": "| Agent tool | Skills / commands | Memory | Hooks | Permissions | MCP | Guide |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| Claude Code | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | [`claude-code`](docs/guides/claude-code.md) |\n| CodeBuddy Code | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | [`codebuddy-code`](docs/guides/codebuddy-code.md) |\n| OpenCode | ✓ | ✓ | — | ✓ | ✓ | [`opencode`](docs/guides/opencode.md) |\n| Codex | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | [`codex`](docs/guides/codex.md) |\n| Pi | ✓ | ✓ | — | — | — | [`pi`](docs/guides/pi.md) |\n| Gemini CLI | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | [`gemini-cli`](docs/guides/gemini-cli.md) |\n| Cursor | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | [`cursor`](docs/guides/cursor.md) |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Resources",
      "text": "- Usage guide (install and verify, shared behaviors, per-tool deep dives): [`docs/guides/`](docs/guides/README.md)\n- Example projects, one per bridged agent tool: [`examples/`](examples/)\n- Upstream reference material (official specs): [`docs/reference/`](docs/reference/)\n- Contributor documentation: [`docs/development/`](docs/development/)"
    }
